# EchLub Rust Core

- Deterministic validation/apply/hash
- Integer musical time only in canonical state
- Typed errors/decisions; no panic on malformed input
- No hidden I/O in core crates
- No platform leakage (web-sys, axum in core crates)
- Tests required for invariants
